  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bcfa7cf01b2d1f74",
      "translationZh": "简而言之：我们构建了一项智能体技能，教编码智能体如何编写生产级 CUDA 内核。随后，我们让 Claude 和 Codex 面向两个真实目标开展工作：一个 diffusers 流水线和一个 transformers 模型。智能体端到端地为两者生成了可用的内核，并提供了正确的 PyTorch 绑定和基准测试。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "54317afb145cb89e",
      "translationZh": "编写 CUDA 内核很难。编写能与 transformers 和 diffusers 正确集成的 CUDA 内核更难。其中涉及特定架构的内存访问模式、向量化策略、线程束 shuffle 归约，以及十几种连经验丰富的开发者也会踩中的集成陷阱。这恰恰是智能体技能能够大显身手的那种专业性强、风险高的问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "71b71850f0f35d2d",
      "translationZh": "我们向编码智能体提供了它们所需的领域知识，例如应该针对哪种 GPU 架构、如何组织 kernel-builder 项目、何时使用共享内存而非寄存器，以及如何编写 PyTorch 绑定。剩下的工作由智能体完成。如果你使用过 LLM 训练技能，或读过《我们让 Claude 教开放模型》，就会对这种模式感到熟悉：将领域专业知识封装成一项技能，让智能体面向一个问题，然后放手让它工作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a01918e0bd9c6354",
      "translationZh": "为什么要为内核开发一项技能？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "476acf978b98e358",
      "translationZh": "Kernel Hub 解决了自定义硬件内核的分发问题。只需一次 get_kernel 调用，你就可以从 Hub 加载预编译内核。无需构建，也无需设置标志。不过，仍然需要有人来编写这些内核。这项技能填补的正是这一空缺。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "78c11311ab348271",
      "translationZh": "CUDA 内核开发涉及的知识面和复杂度令人望而生畏：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "89aff150d3cb71fb",
      "translationZh": "每一代 GPU 都有针对其硬件的优化指南。H100、A100 和 T4 各自具有不同的计算能力、共享内存大小和带宽特性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c6a2cef9d23216b2",
      "translationZh": "在库层面，diffusers 和 transformers 具有不同的模块层级结构、归一化约定和集成模式。自定义内核需要在 PyTorch 中注册，才能被 torch.compile 识别。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "51ddce1432ddca31",
      "translationZh": "在分发时，内核可能依赖于 CUDA、Pytorch 和 Python 的版本，从而形成庞大的环境组合矩阵。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a641a2bbfc296edb",
      "translationZh": "这些领域知识往往散落在文档标签页和 Stack Overflow 的回答中。智能体技能将其打包为可按需加载的上下文。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "369dde5455de415f",
      "translationZh": "首先，我们来展示如何立即使用这项技能，然后再深入介绍我们对内核进行基准测试的细节。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c6c6a2b0f05daed4",
      "translationZh": "安装技能",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "54face572ac7b1ea",
      "translationZh": "这项技能随 kernels 库一同提供。只需一条命令，就能将其安装到你的编程智能体中：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "891680f0b068dffd",
      "translationZh": "这会将技能放入 .claude/skills/cuda-kernels/，Claude Code 和 Cursor 会自动识别并加载它。对于其他智能体：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cfad6126f50c33f0",
      "translationZh": "安装完成后，向你的智能体输入提示：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5bbf2a6118197d46",
      "translationZh": "或者，你也可以采用更开放式的提示：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1c85182cbe717f8c",
      "translationZh": "智能体可以读取该技能，选择合适的架构参数，生成 CUDA 源代码，编写 PyTorch 绑定，配置 build.toml，并创建基准测试脚本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a724a1e838dcbd64",
      "translationZh": "如果你正在开发该技能未涵盖的更复杂的内核，或进行特定架构的优化，那么该技能提供的基础构建模块和模式可以帮助你起步。我们也欢迎对该技能本身作出贡献。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b87198583037f053",
      "translationZh": "该技能包含哪些内容",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b430ecb54bbb3e3a",
      "translationZh": "该技能包含约 550 个 token 的结构化指导，以及参考脚本、GPU 优化指南、故障排查文档和完整的可运行示例。Codex 和 Claude 等智能体式编码工具可以读取这些内容，并生成一个可运行的内核项目。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "46917644511f5f94",
      "translationZh": "它涵盖：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d2819a45de3fb733",
      "translationZh": "针对 H100、A100 和 T4 的 NVIDIA GPU 架构感知优化（计算能力、内存带宽、共享内存大小、线程块大小设置）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8e41465b590ada14",
      "translationZh": "diffusers 和 transformers 的集成模式，包括各个库特有的易错之处",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "973778eab1728ee1",
      "translationZh": "具有向量化内存访问模式的 BF16、FP16 和 FP32 内核模板",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4ce61f979d55b979",
      "translationZh": "用于独立内核微基准测试和端到端流水线比较的基准测试工作流",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "31f19134acc75bc5",
      "translationZh": "通过 get_kernel 集成 HuggingFace Kernel Hub，以加载社区内核",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5010a523d1e05d46",
      "translationZh": "当智能体加载这项技能时，它就获得了从“给我写一个 RMSNorm 内核”到构建一个可构建、可进行基准测试的项目所需的一切。它会使用 grep 和 glob 搜索这项技能，以找到相关文件和目录。因此，采用便于查找的方式来组织这项技能很重要。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e7b5179f99402487",
      "translationZh": "智能体被要求生成符合 references/kernel-templates.md 中模板的内核，并产出一个完整的内核项目：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6c3bc488b4ef2d89",
      "translationZh": "我们在两个真实目标上对此进行了测试。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "da63155bd1f750d5",
      "translationZh": "内核基准测试：Diffusers（H100 上的 LTX-Video）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2f408125c3799ce6",
      "translationZh": "智能体为 LTX-Video 构建了 RMSNorm、RoPE 3D、GEGLU 和 AdaLN 内核。LTX-Video 是来自 diffusers 的视频生成流水线。完整示例位于 examples/ltx_video/。我们针对 H100 优化了 RMSNorm 内核。两项基准测试均在 H100 80GB HBM3 上运行，采用 BFloat16 精度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2d182c3037407c37",
      "translationZh": "如果你想查看生成的内核，请前往这个示例",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fc1ad79d4b216812",
      "translationZh": "独立 RMSNorm 基准测试",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c990e77d57a56d17",
      "translationZh": "首先，我们将独立 RMSNorm 内核的性能与 PyTorch 基线进行比较。这是优化后流水线中最主要的加速来源。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "16d1c9050a0b32e8",
      "translationZh": "表格",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e0e492707f85ff1f",
      "translationZh": "形状",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
