    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "00aff8028cbb9eb7",
      "translationZh": "平均加速比：1.88x，带宽效率：达到 H100 理论带宽（3,350 GB/s）的 34.7%",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "91c2c037099f0210",
      "translationZh": "端到端视频生成（49 帧，30 步，H100 80GB）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fe5b74e1651829bb",
      "translationZh": "接下来，我们将优化后的内核的端到端视频生成性能与基线（不编译）以及 torch.compile 基线进行比较。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
