    {
      "id": "b0091",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e0bff4b82d13f741",
      "translationZh": "1.43倍",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0092",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "66666cde75af9607",
      "translationZh": "RMSNorm 约占 LTX-Video 总计算量的 ~5%。其余时间用于注意力计算、线性投影和 VAE 解码。单一内核类型带来的 6% 端到端加速与这一计算分布相符。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0093",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fabb99fa39668218",
      "translationZh": "内核基准测试：Transformers（H100 上的 Qwen3-8B）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0094",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dad821f75f3075d5",
      "translationZh": "智能体为 Qwen3-8B 构建了一个 RMSNorm 内核。Qwen3-8B 是 transformers 中的一个大语言模型，其 32 层中共有 65 个 RMSNorm 模块。完整示例位于 examples/qwen3_8b/。我们针对 H100 优化了 RMSNorm 内核。两项基准测试均在 H100 80GB HBM3 上运行，使用 BFloat16 精度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0095",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "87265416fc001fc3",
      "translationZh": "如果你想探索这个内核，可以在这里查看。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0096",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fc1ad79d4b216812",
      "translationZh": "独立 RMSNorm 基准测试",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0097",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "413dc9837146aa6b",
      "translationZh": "我们再次将独立 RMSNorm 内核的性能与 PyTorch 基线进行比较。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0098",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5ea1fe57ab9402b4",
      "translationZh": "平均加速比：1.94x，带宽效率：达到 H100 理论带宽（3,350 GB/s）的 22.3%",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0099",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "16d1c9050a0b32e8",
      "translationZh": "表格",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0100",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e0e492707f85ff1f",
      "translationZh": "形状",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0101",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f2bbea9c96c91ff3",
      "translationZh": "自定义（ms）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0102",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ddb3b7fb92ae8640",
      "translationZh": "PyTorch（毫秒）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0103",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6b3a3a6c60431328",
      "translationZh": "加速比",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0107",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4af5d6b42b758230",
      "translationZh": "1.58 倍",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0111",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "853e4e9a84d8f1cf",
      "translationZh": "1.69 倍",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0115",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f703ff5296be8b1f",
      "translationZh": "1.90倍",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0123",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cc1613bcfa548181",
      "translationZh": "2.12 倍",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0127",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6b0e0daffd380421",
      "translationZh": "1.67 倍",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0131",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "caa021566df0cf6b",
      "translationZh": "2.06 倍",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0135",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6bf425f35b308a37",
      "translationZh": "2.47倍",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0136",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b0b88c34b4f7acbd",
      "translationZh": "加速比随序列长度增加而提升：在 128 个 token 时为 1.58x，在 8192 个 token 时为 2.47x。对于长上下文推理，自定义内核可将 RMSNorm 的延迟大致减半。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0137",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e5cde9ea1d7271e7",
      "translationZh": "将你的内核发布到 Hub",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0138",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0b4adcb2e24c9492",
      "translationZh": "智能体会为你提供一个可运行的内核。Kernel Hub 让你能够分享它，以便任何人都能无需编译即可加载它。下面是从智能体输出到发布内核的完整流程。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0139",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c557a026da9503cc",
      "translationZh": "1. 验证项目结构",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0140",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "09eb66381e1a79d4",
      "translationZh": "智能体生成的项目已经遵循 kernel-builder 的目录布局：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0141",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b1468e6877a793c0",
      "translationZh": "build.toml 告诉 kernel-builder 要构建什么。智能体会为你生成这个文件，其中包含适用于目标 GPU 的正确 cuda-capabilities：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0142",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4161f384a9edc50a",
      "translationZh": "2. 使用 Nix 构建所有变体",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0143",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "926625c7410207c6",
      "translationZh": "Kernel Hub 上的内核必须支持所有近期的 PyTorch 和 CUDA 配置。kernel-builder Nix flake 会自动处理这一点。将示例 flake.nix 复制到你的项目中，然后运行：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0144",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b6c0823aed098898",
      "translationZh": "这会为每一种所需的 PyTorch/CUDA 变体构建内核，并将结果放入 build/。要加快构建速度，请启用 HuggingFace Nix 缓存：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0145",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3b0b1ff62c5a221f",
      "translationZh": "3. 创建 Hub 仓库并推送",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0146",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c852515c8efff207",
      "translationZh": "在 Hub 上创建一个模型仓库，并上传构建好的内核：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0147",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "84cb4085a5b52ca6",
      "translationZh": "4. 其他人只需一行代码即可加载",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0148",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7d7acdd22963957e",
      "translationZh": "发布后，任何人都可以使用你的内核，无需任何编译：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0149",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "456f1758ef515f81",
      "translationZh": "get_kernel 会检测用户的 Python、PyTorch 和 CUDA 版本，并下载匹配的预编译二进制文件。无需构建，无需设置标志，通常几秒钟就能就绪。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0150",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "187907e96f107ca4",
      "translationZh": "技能与 Hub 相辅相成。技能负责开发，Hub 负责分发。用技能构建内核，用基准测试脚本验证它，再将其发布到 Hub，其他所有人就都能用一行代码调用它。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0151",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "89db2ad881f29c18",
      "translationZh": "结论",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0152",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "49caace91fee97c2",
      "translationZh": "我们构建了一项智能体技能，教编码智能体如何编写生产级 CUDA 内核。随后，我们让 Claude 和 Codex 面向两个实际目标开展工作：一个 diffusers 流水线和一个 transformers 模型。智能体端到端地为这两个目标生成了可运行的内核，并提供了正确的 PyTorch 绑定和基准测试。我们对这些内核进行了基准测试，发现优化后的内核能够在独立性能和端到端性能两方面带来加速。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0153",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e89b30aa1dc30a6a",
      "translationZh": "资源",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0154",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5b255857febb32ce",
      "translationZh": "kernels 中的 CUDA 内核技能",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0155",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0ad643654f92a626",
      "translationZh": "HuggingFace Kernel Hub 博客",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0156",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0efd344e62f3334b",
      "translationZh": "我们让 Claude 微调了一个开源 LLM",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0157",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "452c781090738c2c",
      "translationZh": "我们让 Claude 教导开放模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0158",
      "kind": "list-item",
